        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-02T17:23:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So absolutely love everything about this world. I'm sure this question gets asked a lot and I had assumed that the only comic of SOTM there was, was Annual #1. Well, I've recently found the Podcast that discusses the lore of the characters and I've been tearing through as fast as I can. I've noticed though that they are referencing&nbsp;several books and stories (Like the Trial of Baron Blade) and I've been looking all over the internet trying to find these comics.&nbsp;<br>So I have to ask, are there any comics that have been written for these characters outside of Annual #1, or are they referencing their own storyboards and note cards as they tell us?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:00.393Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
